  "unitName": "3. Social Engineering",
  "unitDescription": "This unit teaches social engineering through the Blue Lantern campaign against Harborview Expo. Players analyze mobile lures, human vulnerability triggers, physical access pretexts, and computer-based scams while preserving evidence and shaping the response through persona decisions.",
  "defaultPlayerName": "Alex",
  "unitEntryMessage": "Welcome back, {player}. Harborview Expo opens tomorrow, and staff are already receiving suspicious texts, calls, app links, QR redirects, and calendar invites. Asha Moreno will guide the first response. Your job is to connect the Blue Lantern evidence without blaming the people being targeted.",
